# Kiro skill artifacts (app-review, judgement, steering-maintenance)
**/.app-review/
**/.judgement/
**/.steering-maintenance/

# Compiled Go binary (regenerated by `go build`); should not be committed.
/vibekit
# Local-dev Go workspace (resolves unpublished sibling modules via replace);
# never committed — CI builds from the published module proxy.
go.work
go.work.sum
node_modules/
static-src/node_modules/
static-src/node_modules/.vite/
static-src/node_modules/.vite-temp/
.vitest-cache/
# TypeScript build output and Dockerfile-fetched vendor assets;
# regenerated by tsc + the Dockerfile build stage in prod.
static/*.js
static/wire/
static/handlers/
static/vendor/
# tsc emits compiled .js mirroring the static-src module tree into
# these subdirectories; all build output, never committed.
static/actions/
static/fundamentals/
static/lib/
static/__test-helpers__/

static/style.css

# Stryker mutation-testing artifacts (weekly-stryker.yaml / local npx stryker run)
reports/
.stryker-tmp/
# `inPlace: true` runs Stryker in the real tree (see static-src/stryker.config.json),
# so the vitest-runner writes its per-worker setup files into static-src/ instead
# of into the sandbox, and nothing removes them afterwards.
static-src/stryker-setup-*.js

# Review/audit evidence notes (functional-review runs)
.audit/
static/chunks/
static/*.map
static/*.gz

# Byte-compiled Python from scripts/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
